d near the adult-only pool on the property and is also the watersport rentals office. Your captain will meet you there and walk down to the vessel with you and your party.\n\n*We highly recommend using the restrooms before the excursion, as there are no public restrooms on the bay.*\n\n##PARKING FOR THE ACTIVITY##\nPlease note that we do not validate parking. Unless you are staying at Kona Kai, San Diego parking is provided on the street and at the park across from the hotel. That being said, remember to arrive early, as parking can be difficult on weekends, holidays, and during the summer.", "is_latlng_used_for_directions": true, "latitude": 32.71049, "longitude": -117.231219, "tripadvisor_url": "", "google_place_id": "EjQxNTUxIFNoZWx0ZXIgSXNsYW5kIERyIHN1aXRlIDEwOCwgU2FuIERpZWdvLCBDQSwgVVNBIiUaIwoWChQKEgnhQeOTmqvegBGqUURf5gGjVhIJc3VpdGUgMTA4", "google_directions_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=32.710490%2C-117.231219&destination_place_id=EjQxNTUxIFNoZWx0ZXIgSXNsYW5kIERyIHN1aXRlIDEwOCwgU2FuIERpZWdvLCBDQSwgVVNBIiUaIwoWChQKEgnhQeOTmqvegBGqUURf5gGjVhIJc3VpdGUgMTA4"}, "end_location": null, "timezone": null, "display_short_name_with_timezone": "San Diego Bay - High‑Speed History & Sea Lion Discovery Tour", "is_rental": false, "has_combos": false}}
